{%- comment -%}
PlugPal™ product page (template: product.plugpal). One self-contained section in the live Mirevia look:
Blomar-style gallery + buy box, then the proof sections. Styles: assets/plugpal-pdp.css (scoped to #plugpal).
Behaviour: assets/plugpal-pdp.js. Source and notes: plugpal/ in the Mirevia repo.
Packs: the buy button adds the variant whose options match the colour and the pack size (1 / 2 / 4).
If the product has no pack option, it adds the colour variant with quantity = pack size.
Reviews: the testimonial carousel is built from the Judge.me review widget rendered in #reviews (see the inline script near the end).
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'plugpal-pdp.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Inter:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,800&display=swap">
{%- style -%}
#plugpal .pp-tm__track{display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:calc((100% - 3 * 16px) / 4);gap:16px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px 2px}
#plugpal .pp-tm__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
#plugpal .pp-tm__card{scroll-snap-align:start;margin:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-lg);padding:14px 14px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;text-align:center;min-width:0}
#plugpal .pp-tm__card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1 / 1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--r)}
#plugpal .pp-tm__card .pp-stars{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px}
#plugpal .pp-tm__head{font-weight:700 !important;color:var(--navy);font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.3}
#plugpal .pp-tm__body{margin:0;padding:0;border:0;color:#33415c;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
#plugpal .pp-tm__who{margin-top:auto;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}
#plugpal .pp-tm__who b{color:var(--navy)}
#plugpal .pp-tm__ver{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600 !important;font-size:12.5px}
#plugpal .pp-tm__src{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
#plugpal .pp-tm__summary{margin-top:10px}
#plugpal .pp-tm__all{margin-top:40px}
#plugpal .pp-tm__all--hidden{position:absolute !important;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)}
#plugpal .pp-rating .jdgm-preview-badge{display:flex;justify-content:center}
@media (max-width:1000px){#plugpal .pp-tm__track{grid-auto-columns:calc((100% - 2 * 16px) / 2.6)}}
@media (max-width:600px){#plugpal .pp-tm__track{grid-auto-columns:82%}}
{%- endstyle -%}
